Hardware Requirements
---------------------

Watchdog runs on the Psion S3 128k/256k version, or in the S3
emulation mode on the Psion S3a 256k/512k versions.  A S3a version is
in the pipeline, if you are interested then please register and inform
me you are interested in an S3a version, it will be sent to you as
soon as it is ready.

Watchdog requires approx 24k to run, 12k is the controler which is
only temporary, 12k is the resident part which must be running for
watchdog to provide password protection.

